Journal - a diary with a page for every day
==========================================

!Journal, in the Apps directory, is a diary to write in: a page for
each day, a calendar that shows which days you have written on (with
the day's mood and weather), a way to find anything you have written,
and a look back at what you wrote on this date in other years. Every
page is an ordinary Text file, so !Edit and the Filer can see your
journal too - unless you lock it with a password.

It is written in JavaScript, and it is all on the disc: you can read
it (and change it) in !JsEdit, like the programs in the Programming
guide.

